WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers,
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.003
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.038
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:06.372
President Biden spoke today

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:08.207
at the White House
Summit for Democracy.

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:11.311
The speech went so well, we're
even thinking about trying it.

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:13.346
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.548
House Speaker Kevin McCarthy
sent President Biden

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:18.117
a letter yesterday morning
and asked him to pick a date

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:20.953
to continue negotiations
over raising the debt ceiling

00:00:20.953 --> 00:00:23.122
because nothing conveys
the desire

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:26.059
to get something done quickly
like sending a letter.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:27.994
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:29.596
That's right.
House Speaker Kevin McCarthy

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:31.330
sent President Biden
in a letter yesterday

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:35.001
and outlined Republican demands
for raising the debt ceiling

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:37.904
and, for the greater good,
Hillary's agreed to it.

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:41.807
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:43.276
Not real. Don't worry.

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:45.145
President Biden
told reporters yesterday

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:46.913
that he has already used
the full extent

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:49.348
of his executive authority
to ban assault weapons

00:00:49.348 --> 00:00:51.450
and added that Congress
"has to act."

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:54.320
"Well, I did win
the Oscar for 'Lincoln,'"

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.855
said George Santos.

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:58.858
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:01.293
A bipartisan group of
congressmen announced this week

00:01:01.293 --> 00:01:02.495
that they will reintroduce

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.897
the Protection from
Abusive Passengers Act,

00:01:04.897 --> 00:01:06.632
which would ban
airline passengers

00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:09.436
who've been fined or convicted
of physical violence on flights

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:12.939
and prison time for anyone who
takes off their shoes and socks.

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:14.874
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:16.309
According to a new report,

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:19.312
former First Lady Melania Trump
likes living at Mar-a-Lago

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:21.180
because she's surrounded
by people

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:24.117
who do not say bad things
about former President Trump.

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:27.720
Okay, but word of advice,
don't go in the kitchen.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:31.424
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:35.461
Pepsi yesterday unveiled its new
logo design for North America.

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:37.964
And it's fine, I guess,
if that's all you have.

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:39.999
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:44.804
Shoemaker. I was like,
"I'm not sure about that one."

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:48.541
And Shoemaker was like, "That's
an excellent joke about Pepsi."

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:50.209
That's why -- I guess
that's about it, though.

00:01:50.209 --> 00:01:53.645
Like, Pepsi's got
a lower ceiling.

00:01:53.645 --> 00:01:56.616
Honda has issued a recall
for more than 300,000 vehicles

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.484
due to an issue
with the side view mirrors.

00:01:58.484 --> 00:02:01.955
Apparently what happened was all
the objects in the mirror

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:04.090
are exactly as close
as they appear.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:06.693
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.994 --> 00:02:11.564
A driver in Minnesota reportedly
gave a sheriff's deputy

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:14.433
a get-out-of-jail-free card
from the board game Monopoly

00:02:14.433 --> 00:02:17.770
along with his license
during a recent traffic stop.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:20.206
But it didn't work and he ended
up getting his car towed.

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:24.543
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.543 --> 00:02:26.946
A Great Dane in Virginia
recently gave birth

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:30.316
to 21 puppies
over 27 hours of labor.

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:31.684
Though, when it was
all said and done,

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:33.186
it turned out
she was a Chihuahua.

00:02:33.186 --> 00:02:35.955
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:40.426
[ Laughter ]
That's right.

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:41.861
A Great Dane in Virginia

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:44.196
recently gave birth
to 21 puppies.

00:02:44.196 --> 00:02:46.566
Well, she certainly knows
"roll over."

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:49.502
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:55.775
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:57.843
Scollins.

00:02:57.843 --> 00:02:59.912
According to a new study,
Jacksonville, Florida,

00:02:59.912 --> 00:03:01.581
has the worst drivers
in the country.

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:03.883
Said drivers, "Let me see that!"

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:06.385
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.385 --> 00:03:07.820
And finally, scientists believe

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.122
they've found a new source
of water on the moon,

00:03:10.122 --> 00:03:12.958
and Gwyneth Paltrow already
has it up on her site.

00:03:12.958 --> 00:03:15.895
And that -- that was
a monologue, everybody.

